  "description": "The world championship-winning Quartz Frame is now available in a 24” Cruiser version! Utilising the Sliding Dropout Disc System (SDDS) with a flat mount style calliper and internal cable routing, the Cruiser version also comes with V-brake mounts allowing you to ride it any way you want to. One of the lightest and most progressive alloy frames on the market just got bigger!\n\n• NEW 24” cruiser version of the new Quartz frame\n• two sizes (PRO L and PRO XL)\n• forged and CNC machined Sliding Dropout Disc System (SDDS) with integrated chain tensioner\n• super lightweight alloy frame (100g less than the Helium frame)\n• Paradigm superior tubing\n• flat mount disc brake (with internal cable routing) and v-brakes (external routing)\n• Designed for 140mm and 120mm rotors (please check 120mm rotor fitment with an authorised Radio Bikes dealer based on your hub and brake calliper dimensions)",
